oyed and working with lawyers to pursue her case.\" Once again we see men rewarded and the women who report sexual harassment, their lives are pulled apart. #MeToo \nhttps:\/\/t.co\/9O5rFpFvvP","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":147,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1108744490276306945","date":1553180260000,"rawContent":"My favorite quote from this @byshondaland profile of Amanda Nguyen of @RiseNowUS is: \"I realized I could accept injustice, or I could rewrite the law.\". Amanda is a badass and I am forever grateful for her work\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/Yh3qjEOZSE #MeToo #BelieveSurvivors","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":148,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1110543376112386048","date":1553609148000,"rawContent":"This is a prime example of victim blaming. This is why victims don't come forward, this is what we mean when we say we are terrified we won't be believed. ESPECIALLY when it comes from those within our own communities. I #BelieveSurvivors, I always have and I always will. #MeToo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":149,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rolli